  "title": "Jazzy Crisp Thai Chicken Kao Mun Gai",
  "description": "A nutty and crisp Thai dish featuring ground clove and nimono-simmer, perfect for a lazy Sunday, this anti-inflammatory friendly recipe is a variation of the traditional Bangkok street food Kao Mun Gai.",
