  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the ground chicken and cook until browned, breaking it up into small pieces as it cooks.",
    "Add the ground clove, fish sauce, and lime juice, and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chopped Thai basil.",
    "Serve the chicken mixture over the cooked jasmine rice."
